      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Gulf-View Townhome • Steps to Beach Access • Inlet Beach<br><br>Seaclusion, a quaint and cozy 2-bedroom, 2.5-bath Gulf-view townhome perfectly located in serene Inlet Beach — just steps from the sugar-white sands and emerald waters of the Gulf. A unique blend of vintage Florida charm, this end-unit retreat is ideal for couples, small families, or friends looking to unwind in one of 30A's most peaceful communities.<br><br>Situated just steps from Lupine Beach access and close to Camp Helen State Park, stroll to pristine shoreline, explore scenic nature paths, or take a short bike ride to the shops and dining in Rosemary Beach and along 30Avenue. Inside, Seaclusion offers a cozy coastal-inspired experience with comfortable furnishings throughout. <br><br>Beach Access: Lupine Beach Access is in Inlet Beach at the end of South Walton Lakeshore Drive.<br><br>Sleeping Arrangements<br>- King in 2nd floor primary bedroom; bath; TV<br>- King in 2nd floor room; bath; TV<br>- Sleeper sofa in living room <br><br>PROPERTY HIGHLIGHTS:<br>* Just steps to Lupine Beach Access<br>* Gulf Views! Large Balconies<br>* Outdoor Shower - Perfect for rinsing off after a long day of enjoying the beach<br>* Complimentary Wi-Fi <br>* Pots, Pans, & Cooking Utensils Provided<br>* Coffee Maker<br>* Explore Rosemary Beach, 30Avenue, Alys Beach<br>* Full-Size Washer & Dryer<br>* Easy Beach Access<br>* Camp Helen State Park is your next-door neighb<br>* Complete Clean Linen - ALL linens, including comforters laundered upon every checkout<br><br> Seaclusion is Professionally Managed by 30A Rental Properties<br><br>30A Rental Properties is here to make sure you have a great time staying at one of our luxury properties. Please feel free to contact us with any questions. With our Complete Clean Linen Promise - ALL linens, including comforters laundered upon every checkout.<br><br>Very Important: ( We encourage all our guests to purchase travel protection insurance to protect against any unforeseen trip interruptions or you needing to cancel. )<br><br>- VERY IMPORTANT - WE DO NOT ACCEPT WIRE TRANSFERS.<br>- No Smoking<br>- No pets allowed<br>- Minimum age of primary renter must be 25 and must stay on property for the entire length of stay. No Spring Breakers without Parents, this is strictly enforced. <br>- No Rv's, Trailers, Boat's or Watercraft's allowed to be parked at the property - Due to HOA Rule.<br>- Check-in is 4:00 PM CST. Checkout is 10:00 AM CST.<br>- CONSTRUCTION IS IN PLACE ALL OVER 30A. We cannot be held responsible for construction near the home.<br>- Notice of County Sound Ordinance - Prohibited act. It shall be unlawful and a violation of the section for a person to make, cause or permit if within his or her control the making or causing of any noise disturbance between the hours of 10:00 p.m. and 6:00 a.m. that is plainly audible from within an occupied residence not the residence of the person making, causing or permitting the making or causing of the noise disturbance.<br><br>30A Rental Properties Rental Agreement: By submitting payment for this reservation, you agree that you have read, understood and agree to adhere to and be bound by the terms and conditions of this agreement, thus making it a legal binding contract. Please contact us immediately if you have any questions or concerns",
